  "title": "Exercises for sciatica",
  "creator": "NHS",
  "description": "Five daily stretches by physiotherapist Nick Sinfield for the NHS to ease sciatic pain: knee to chest, sciatic mobilising stretch, back extensions, standing hamstring stretch and lying deep gluteal stretch. Holds are 20 to 30 seconds and repeated 2 or 3 times per leg. Stop and see a GP if pain is severe or does not improve within a few weeks.",
